      541.19
    ],
    "text": "I hereby give notice, under sub-section (1) of section 7 ofLand acquisition Act, as Amended by the Land Acquisition(Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the Governmentintends to acquire the following land/servitude* which isrequired for public purpose.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      69.84,
      551.52,
      309.99,
      585.59
    ],
    "text": "Acquisition for alternative land for the people displaceddue to heavy rain and landslides (Under village ExpansionProgramme).",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      79.92,
      594.72,
      294.3,
      604.79
    ],
    "text": "Description of the Land or servitude to be Acquired:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      69.84,
      615.12,
      309.82,
      685.19
    ],
    "text": "An plot of land called Enasalmada Watta in extent of about1.6387 Hectares depicted as Lot 1 in the P.P.M. 1698 preparedby Senior Superintendent of Survey, Matale and situated atEnasalmada village in Enasalmada Grama Niladhari inKohonsiyapatthuwa minor division in Ukuwela DivisionalSecretary's division in Matale District in Central Province.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
