      321.84,
      439.92,
      561.92,
      461.99
    ],
    "text": "Claimant: State Plantation Cooperation, No. 11, Duke Street,Colombo 01.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      321.84,
      469.68,
      562.04,
      582.47
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid/lands* on which aservitude is to be acquired are hereby required to appearpersonally, or by agents duly authorized in writing before meat Ukuwela Divisional Secretariat on the 21st day of August2019 at 10.30 a.m. and are hereby requested to notify to me inwriting (in duplicate) on or before the 07th day of August2019 the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars oftheir claims for compensationfor the acquisition of the saidland/servitude* the amount of compensation and the detailsof the computation of such amount.",
